# Oracle: run F13 (scratchpad vacask/run130, settle run/save_current): an isource's, a
# resistor's, a vccs's and a cccs's current is `p(x, i)` (they have no `i(x)`), a vsource's and
# a vcvs's `i(x)`; a path is `i('x1:l1')` as before.
file "save_current.ir" deck
  title "save of element currents"
  device_library resistor
  model vs source_v
  model is source_i
  model r resistor
  model e vcvs
  model g vccs
  model f cccs
  element vsource v1 (1 0) model=vs dc=1i
  element isource i1 (7 0) model=is dc=1m
  element resistor r1 (1 2) model=r value=1k
  element vcvs e1 (3 0 2 0) model=e gain=2i
  element vccs g1 (4 0 2 0) model=g gain=1m
  element cccs f1 (6 0) model=f gain=3i sense=v1
  save analysis=(op dc tran) from_here (i (r1)) (i (i1)) (i (g1)) (i (f1)) (i (v1)) (i (e1)) (i (x1 l1))
  analysis op name=op1
